<title>HUNGARY: Budapest BSE suspends Danubius for day.</title>
<headline>Budapest BSE suspends Danubius for day.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange has suspended trading in hotelier Danubius for Wednesday as the company was unable to comment press reports that the Competition Office has approved the purchase of Hungaria Szalloda Rt by Danubius.</p>
<p>&quot;Danubius was unable to confirm or deny press report of the approval,&quot; a BSE official told Reuters.  </p>
<p>National daily Nepszabadsag carried a report of the approval by the Competition Office (CO), which was later confirmed to Reuters by CO officials.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
